<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18515" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίσ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			D.H.
			2.24
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>Am.</u>
			12
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Ael.
			<u>NA</u>
			1.2
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to
				the goddess of love,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Semon.
					7.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					166
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					183b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθύρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Com.
					2D.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					2D.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archipp.
					2D.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμέναιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					12D.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίσια, τά,</span>
			<i>sexual pleasures,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>, as <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				81b
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρπν᾽ ἄνθε᾽ Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν ὡραίων Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.6.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Jusj.</u>
				</span></i>
			:—also as concrete, =
			<i>amasius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.3.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>festival of Aphrodite,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ. ἄγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.4.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				253.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pudenda,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίσιον, τό,</span>
			<i>temple of Aphrodite,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5075.70
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Crete</span>); <i>her statue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>brothels,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				6.29
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίσιος, ὁ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of a month in Cyprus, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.54
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
